 {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory2_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "901028398300270", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974869_901028401633603_627257832616781480_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tLCijXcvwTwQ7kNvwHJa_NU&_nc_oc=AdmsMrzLOuM6D1jEkawlvrSirG9mHAiQlrZrrgdjNa-xy9PQQpEeyoJPiNo9vObrpaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzzGzkbvKudSQ9gccEeabyOSEa3pHxJmoroysbPCY1fNw&oe=69B56E1F"}, {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory1_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "985952625960516", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254875_985952629293849_7550419092568334009_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JqrCStZHDk4Q7kNvwGyNWIC&_nc_oc=AdkUQ_N-xOXJ5dnuo54nkcwTHDkqFbwhkUgrW7xULtnseyZC-8tcFLk9YvC4DHdNLyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyjESVpFSnayHBXanF4cSfat8ai8zyoJlWfRTrPM7k-GQ&oe=69B56220"}, {"file_name": "VRTherapy_Cam_Sensory_Wide_3840x2160 (Custom).png", "id": "3552569408344767", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031495_3552569411678100_5955106357745012263_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t8zTFf_owvcQ7kNvwFwZ1qJ&_nc_oc=AdnTlTjgYEzQ6OgrcNY1BINmzAHskJ5dJ1_hBDrb74PaAKpORu4d7LSQUOjMid3cYG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyKDOBoTzSA72pHFMUegsjcXfcr3wvnN_sICe__CHzSZg&oe=69B55375"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-art_landscape.png", "id": "862962371915225", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982538_862962375248558_5129333378553841424_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SW4vzOrrzCUQ7kNvwHaC0tP&_nc_oc=Adl-stNa67JfG-joBp4qi944HSeXHDp0X3Nb_3Di87t3e1qdPvMgmgoe6RzATt4GjSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz8W9tF34TBQZPGdbsID2kuQCxxMJhGRP-_AkEmpvfy9g&oe=69B544CA"}, "display_name": "Sensory Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Imagine if you could be instantly transported to a magical, calming world. \n\n\ud83c\udfb6 \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f A place where you could let go of everyday stresses and be soothed by relaxing visuals, tactile sensations and gentle sounds.\n\nNOW YOU CAN!\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Inspired by the many hundreds of real-life Sensory Rooms in the world, Your VR Therapy now makes it possible to experience these important relaxation facilities virtually.\n\nAnd for a tiny fraction of the cost.\n\n**WHAT ARE SENSORY ROOMS?**\nThese are widely used to help people with stress issues and learning difficulties. They offer a safe space to unwind and engage in gently stimulating activities.\n\n**OUR VIRTUAL SENSORY ROOM **\nFrom the comfort of your home, you can now enter a realm of relaxation and sensory exploration \u2013 instantly. \n\nCreated in collaboration with trained Sensory Room experts, our space offers:\n\n\u2013 CALMING VISUALS -- \n\n\u2013 SOOTHING SOUNDS \u2013\n\n\u2013 INTERACTIVE OBJECTS \u2013\n\nWhich all help to promote comfort and self-discovery.\n\nThis virtual oasis has been developed for both adults and their family members in need of some safe, relaxing 'me' time.\n\nIt offers a rare opportunity to step away from the stresses of everyday life.\n\nOur highly interactive app:\n- Enables you to let off steam in a secure, controlled environment.\n- Promotes individual play and discovery.\n- Is designed by experts to enhance emotional development.\n- Requires no travel to a physical location.\n\nSTART YOUR RELAXATION TODAY!", "short_description": "Your VR Therapy's virtual Sensory Room is a highly interactive and engaging alternative to expensive real-world Sensory Rooms, which are widely used in both clinical and educational settings.\n\nOur expertly-designed VR space allows you to enter a calming virtual room and embark on a journey of relaxation in your own home.\n\nDownload today and discover this revolutionary new way of enjoying the Sensory Room experience with zero fuss, travel or ongoing expense."}]}